# Local environment for best.serp.co.
#
# Don't put credentials in .env files: the OpenNext build inlines .env values into the Worker
# bundle. Worker secrets such as BETTER_AUTH_SECRET go in apps/web/.dev.vars locally (see
# apps/web/.dev.vars.example and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) and in `wrangler secret put` per deployed
# environment. Scripts that call GitHub read GITHUB_TOKEN from your shell, for example
# `GITHUB_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) pnpm media:health:issue`.
